{
  "uid": "app-foundry",
  "title": "App Foundry",
  "description": "Estado del servicio y uso del producto. Arriba, si funciona; abajo, si sirve para algo.",
  "tags": ["app-foundry"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Servicio",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Peticiones por segundo",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_count[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Las tres de siempre —tráfico, errores y latencia— por ruta. Es lo primero que se mira cuando algo va mal, antes de saber qué va mal."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Errores por segundo",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_count{http_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Solo 5xx: un 404 o un 403 son respuestas correctas del sistema, no averías."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Latencia (p95 y p50)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{http_route}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "El p95 y no la media: la media esconde justo los casos que la gente recuerda. RNF-202 pide por debajo de 300 ms en listado y ficha."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Consultas a Postgres",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (db_operation) (rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{db_operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Si una petición se ralentiza, aquí se ve si es la base de datos o no."
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "title": "Uso del producto",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Anclas huérfanas",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(foundry_anchors_orphaned_total[15m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "huérfanas/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "El panel que hay que mirar. Un ancla huérfana es un comentario que ha perdido su sitio en el texto. Que aparezca alguna es normal —el documento cambia—, pero un pico significa que el reanclaje está fallando, y eso no se nota por ningún otro lado: nadie abre una incidencia porque sus comentarios se hayan descolocado, simplemente deja de fiarse."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Conexiones de avisos abiertas",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(foundry_sse_connections)",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "abiertas"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Cuántas hay ahora mismo. Si sube y no baja nunca, alguna conexión no se está cerrando y el proceso acabará quedándose sin descriptores."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Actividad",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(foundry_apps_created_total[1h])) * 3600",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "apps/h"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(foundry_document_versions_total[1h])) * 3600",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "versiones/h"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(foundry_comments_created_total[1h])) * 3600",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "comentarios/h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Si esto está plano, la herramienta no se está usando, por muy verdes que estén los demás paneles."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Avisos emitidos",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(foundry_notifications_emitted_total[15m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "avisos/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Un pico sostenido sin actividad detrás suele significar que alguien está recibiendo avisos de más."
    }
  ]
}
